# Local stack only. See law 7 in CLAUDE.md.
#
# Vite loads .env.production for `vite build` and this file for `vite dev` — so without
# it `pnpm dev` starts with no env at all and src/lib/supabase.ts throws at module load.
#
# These point at 127.0.0.1 and are useless against anything else, which is why they are
# committed: a fresh clone should run `pnpm db:start && pnpm dev` and work. They must
# never appear in .env.production or in a hosting provider's environment.
#
# The secret key `supabase start` also prints is NOT here and never should be.
#
# If your stack prints different values, override them in .env.local (gitignored).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_ACJWlzQHlZjBrEguHvfOxg_3BJgxAaH
